('airdrop-bottle-20', 'bottle', 'airdrop', 'Bottle Shoot', 'game', 1, array['any']::text[], 'Scout is on the gun range: shoot the glass bottles — each colour hides one digit. Intel knows which colours open the safe, in order. Decoder knows how to scramble the code.', '{"scout":{"title":"Gun range","body":"Tap a bottle to shoot it. A broken bottle shows its digit; every bottle of that colour hides the same digit. 6 shots, then reload. Shout every colour and digit you find.","game":{"type":"bottle","bottles":[{"c":"red","d":3},{"c":"blue","d":7},{"c":"green","d":2},{"c":"yellow","d":4},{"c":"purple","d":9},{"c":"orange","d":5}],"ammo":6}},"intel":{"title":"Safe order","body":"PURPLE  →  YELLOW  →  ORANGE  →  RED","big":true},"decoder":{"title":"Scramble rule","body":"Subtract each digit from 9."}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"4-digit safe code","accept":["0546"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 150, 'Scout: call out "red is 3, blue is 7…". Intel: read the four colours in order. Decoder: apply the rule last.', 'Purple=9 Yellow=4 Orange=5 Red=3 → 9 minus each digit → 0546', null, 25, 'published'),
